                        // fed. The `Integer.intValue` twin two hundred lines
                        // above calls `note_integer_int_value_direct_site()`
                        // here; this arm bumped only `LONG_LONG_VALUE_SITES` and
                        // left `LONG_LONG_VALUE_DIRECT_SITES` at zero.
